sequenceDiagram
  participant L as OneTextLabel.OnPopulateMesh
  participant C as GlyphClusters
  participant A as GlyphAtlas
  participant O as OutlineExtractor
  participant R as GlyphRasterizer
  participant J as Burst jobs
  participant S as AtlasFlushScheduler

  L->>A: SharedGlyphAtlas.Atlas or PreciseAtlas
  loop per TextRun
    L->>C: Split(font, glyphs, start, count, ...)
    C-->>L: clusters, positioned
    L->>A: PrepareClusters(font, density, positioned, clusters)
    loop per cluster not in _entries
      A->>O: Extract(font, glyphId, scratch, pixelsPerUnit)
      O-->>A: contours (font units)
    end
    A->>R: RasterizeBatch(requests, results, Precise)
    R->>J: Schedule(totalTexels, 128).Complete()
    J-->>R: Output bytes
    R-->>A: RasterizedGlyph per request
    A->>A: Commit, Allocate, WriteSlot, MarkTileDirty
    loop per cluster
      L->>A: GetOrAddCluster(font, density, positioned, start, count, hash)
      A-->>L: GlyphLocation (cache hit, LRU touched)
      L->>L: _quads.Add(TextQuad)
    end
  end
  L->>L: EmitQuads, AddVert x4 per quad
  L->>S: AtlasFlushScheduler.Request()
  S->>A: Flush() once at CanvasUpdate.LatePreRender
